{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Pokémon: Pikachu's Winter Vacation","Pikachu's Winter Vacations are three series of videos, each composed of several Pikachu shorts. All shorts deal with winter and Christmas. This is the first series and contains Christmas Night & Kanga Games."],"ja":["ピカチュウのふゆやすみ",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":10916,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-4874","ids":{"shikimori":4874,"mal":4874,"anilist":4874,"kodik":"serial-43243"},"kodikIds":["serial-43242","serial-43419","serial-43243"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-43242":"2022-05-31T04:18:56Z","serial-43419":"2022-06-11T09:17:04Z","serial-43243":"2022-05-31T04:20:57Z"},"title":"Покемон: Пикачу зимой","originalTitle":"Pikachu no Fuyuyasumi (1999)","alt":"Pocket Monsters: Pikachu no Fuyuyasumi / Pokemon: Pikachu's Winter Vacation Pokémon: Pikachu's Winter Vacation ピカチュウのふゆやすみ","description":"Сатоши (Satoshi), Касуми (Kasumi) ] Такэши (Takeshi) останавливаются в коттедже на зимние праздники. В первой части Пикачу (Pikachu) и его друзья встречаются с Кангасханом и некоторыми другими покемонами и попадают в целую череду приключений. Вторая часть рассказывает о том, как покемоны веселятся, пока их хозяева уходят по магазинам за продуктами к рождественскому ужину.","year":1998,"type":"OVA","genres":["детское","Приключения","Комедия","Фэнтези"],"rating":6.52,"popularity":4340,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[10916],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/4874/4af68d16b9e26d0fa7ba93c48ed6f101.jpeg","width":262,"height":400},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4874-XwyIy49ugffW.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[2],"episodes":[{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-827","dubId":"827","label":"Persona99","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":